---
Astro.response.headers.set("Content-Type", "text/html; charset=utf-8")
Astro.response.headers.set("Cache-Control", "s-max-age=300, stale-while-revalidate")
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>ACE Evaluation API Documentation</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="API reference for the Chainlink ACE Evaluation API. Request and monitor managed offchain policy permits."
    />
    <meta
      name="keywords"
      content="ACE, Evaluation API, Chainlink, Offchain Policy, TRM, Wallet Screening, Permits, API Documentation"
    />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://docs.chain.link/api/ace/evaluation/docs" />

    <meta property="og:title" content="ACE Evaluation API Documentation" />
    <meta
      property="og:description"
      content="Request managed offchain policy evaluations and monitor onchain permit delivery."
    />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://docs.chain.link/api/ace/evaluation/docs" />

    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="ACE Evaluation API Documentation" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="API reference for the Chainlink ACE Evaluation API." />

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://unpkg.com" />
    <link rel="dns-prefetch" href="https://unpkg.com" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="https://unpkg.com/swagger-ui-dist@5.32.0/swagger-ui.css" />

    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "TechArticle",
        "headline": "ACE Evaluation API Documentation",
        "description": "API reference for requesting managed offchain policy evaluations and monitoring permit delivery",
        "author": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Chainlink" },
        "publisher": { "@type": "Organization", "name": "Chainlink" },
        "mainEntityOfPage": {
          "@type": "WebPage",
          "@id": "https://docs.chain.link/api/ace/evaluation/docs"
        }
      }
    </script>

    <style>
      body {
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        font-family:
          -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Oxygen, Ubuntu, Cantarell, "Open Sans", sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333;
      }

      .api-doc-header {
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
        padding: 40px 20px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 1400px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 0 20px;
      }

      h1 {
        color: #375bd2;
        font-size: 2.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      h2 {
        color: #333;
        font-size: 1.8rem;
        margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem;
      }

      .lead {
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        max-width: 800px;
      }

      .api-overview {
        margin: 2rem 0;
        max-width: 800px;
      }

      .mvp-notice {
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 1.5rem 0;
        padding: 16px 20px;
        border: 1px solid #d97706;
        border-radius: 6px;
        background: #fffbeb;
        color: #78350f;
      }

      .version-badge {
        display: inline-block;
        background-color: #375bd2;
        color: white;
        padding: 0.25em 0.8em;
        border-radius: 2em;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        margin-left: 10px;
        vertical-align: middle;
      }

      #swagger-ui {
        max-width: 1460px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .swagger-ui .topbar,
      .swagger-ui .info .title small.version-stamp {
        background-color: #375bd2;
      }

      .swagger-ui .scheme-container {
        background-color: #f8f9fa;
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        h1 {
          font-size: 2rem;
        }

        .api-doc-header {
          padding: 20px 15px;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="api-doc-header">
      <div class="container">
        <h1>ACE Evaluation API <span class="version-badge">v1</span></h1>
        <p class="lead">
          Use the Evaluation API to request managed offchain policy evaluations, monitor TRM wallet screening, and
          determine when an approved permit is ready onchain.
        </p>

        <div class="mvp-notice" role="note">
          <strong>MVP API:</strong> Managed offchain risk policies and the Evaluation API are an MVP. Their interfaces and
          capabilities can change during Beta. Contact your Chainlink representative before integrating this API and for help
          with setup.
        </div>

        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:24px 0;">
          <a
            href="#swagger-ui"
            style="display:inline-block;background:#375bd2;color:#fff;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.95rem;"
            >Explore Endpoints</a
          >
          <a
            href="/api/ace/evaluation/openapi.json"
            style="display:inline-block;background:#fff;color:#375bd2;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:4px;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.95rem;border:1px solid #375bd2;"
            >View OpenAPI Specification</a
          >
        </div>

        <div class="api-overview">
          <h2>Evaluation flow</h2>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>POST /evaluate</strong> — request an evaluation and receive its deterministic permit ID</li>
            <li>
              <strong>GET /evaluate/&#123;permitId&#125;</strong> — monitor evaluation and onchain permit delivery status
            </li>
          </ul>
          <p>
            See <a href="/ace/guides/policy-manager/offchain-policies/request-offchain-permits"
              >Requesting Offchain Permits</a
            > for the integration guide. See also: <a href="/api/ace/coordinator/docs">Coordinator API Reference</a> and
            <a href="/api/ace/reporting/docs">Reporting API Reference</a>.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div id="swagger-ui"></div>

    <script src="https://unpkg.com/swagger-ui-dist@5.32.0/swagger-ui-standalone-preset.js" crossorigin="anonymous" defer
    ></script>
    <script src="https://unpkg.com/swagger-ui-dist@5.32.0/swagger-ui-bundle.js" crossorigin="anonymous" defer></script>

    <script is:inline>
      window.addEventListener("load", function () {
        const ui = SwaggerUIBundle({
          url: "/api/ace/evaluation/openapi.json",
          dom_id: "#swagger-ui",
          deepLinking: true,
          presets: [SwaggerUIBundle.presets.apis, SwaggerUIStandalonePreset],
          plugins: [SwaggerUIBundle.plugins.DownloadUrl],
          layout: "StandaloneLayout",
          defaultModelsExpandDepth: -1,
          defaultModelExpandDepth: 3,
          displayRequestDuration: true,
          docExpansion: "list",
          filter: true,
          showExtensions: true,
          validatorUrl: null,
          tryItOutEnabled: false,
          supportedSubmitMethods: [],
          syntaxHighlight: { activated: true, theme: "monokai" },
        })

        window.ui = ui
      })
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
